publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T06:57:43.1100091Z               },
publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T06:57:43.1100286Z               "id": "efbb401f2a06a5881f0f189a3683836d62dcddc4",
publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T06:57:43.1102102Z               "message": "Parse bounded ZIP debug archives\n\nSentry clients commonly upload dSYM bundles as ZIP archives. The server previously treated the archive itself as one unknown object, so every contained Mach-O or ELF remained unresolved.\n\nExpand ZIP uploads into independent debug objects within explicit entry and uncompressed-byte limits. Preserve each object name, symbols and CFI table, apply the parent Debug ID, and leave malformed or oversized archives non-fatal. Cover a bundle containing Mach-O and ELF through the authenticated HTTP Minidump path.",
publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T06:57:43.1104341Z               "timestamp": "2026-10-21T06:51:42Z",
